    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 1 Saint Aongus Grove to the market, a well-presented three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence ideally positioned in a mature and highly sought-after residential neighbourhood in the heart of Dublin 24. This attractive home offers bright, comfortable living accommodation, generous outdoor space, and exceptional convenience to a wide range of local amenities.\n\nThe property briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living room, a modern fitted kitchen with ample storage and workspace, three well-proportioned bedrooms, and a family bathroom. The contemporary kitchen serves as the heart of the home, providing a stylish and practical space for everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nA standout feature of this property is its generous outdoor space. The large front garden provides excellent kerb appeal and off-street parking potential (subject to planning permission), while the substantial rear garden offers a private setting perfect for children, outdoor dining, gardening enthusiasts, or future extension possibilities (subject to the necessary planning permissions).\n\nLocated in a well-established community, residents benefit from an excellent selection of nearby amenities including schools, parks, sports clubs, local shops, cafes, and supermarkets. The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, TU Dublin Tallaght Campus, and numerous leisure facilities are all within easy reach. Excellent transport links, including the Luas Red Line, Dublin Bus services, and convenient access to the M50 motorway, make commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond both quick and convenient.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families, and investors seeking a spacious home in a location that combines convenience, community, and excellent amenities.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment.\n\nProperties in this established and convenient location are always in strong demand, so interested parties are encouraged to act quickly to avoid disappointment.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout\n* Large front garden & private rear garden - West Facing \n* Excellent potential for extension (subject to planning permission)\n* Mature and established residential location\n* Close to schools, shops, parks and leisure facilities\n* Easy access to Luas, Dublin Bus and the M50\n\n"
      },
